SCOPE: A generalized unboarding agent, welcomes the customer,  based on form filled (name, what they want to buy, etc) it get information. It can take text and voice.


capability: elicit/get info from customer, writes info/response in a DB tied to that customer, at the end of inyeraction is a structured intake form of the customer that has the name, phone no. email etc (what the person wants to buy). LLM confirm if user input is correct, if positive or yes or sure etc, it moves down the graph, 
if negative it moves back to get the necessary detail (name or phone number etc)


objectives:
welcome
get name
get email
get phone no.
get what customer want to do
write all to a database


Program has an input interface that says welcome … --> 
customer inputs 1st input --> 
Program request Full name in a require format -->
Program displays input tab for Customer to input their name. and customer puts in full name in required format, program 
splits the name into first, last, middle name and holds the names in the program state to inserted into database later. --->
Program displays name and input for user to  confirm if the name is correct or not, etc


       
    
    



